false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "They keep doing it, cause there is NEVER any punishment for when judges break the law, judge that hid the illegal from ICE gets off, still keeps her retirement to.", "last_comment_created": 1794714750304, "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>Legal Proceedings and Sentencing Dugan was found guilty in December 2025 on two counts of federal obstruction, though a jury did not convict her of concealing a fugitive. U.S. District Judge Lynn Adelman sentenced her to a $5,000 fine, describing the conduct as \u201ca few minutes of someone who has dedicated her life to public service.\u201d He noted that Dugan\u2019s decades of service and lack of a criminal pattern warranted a sentence less severe than the federal guidelines, which recommended 15 to 20 months in prison and allowed a maximum of five years. The judge emphasized that Dugan had already faced \u201csignificant punishment,\u201d including the loss of her judicial position, retirement from the bench, and the personal toll of public scrutiny..</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://theuntamedtruth.com/news/former-wisconsin-judge-hannah-dugan-avoids-prison-after-ice-confrontation\" target=\"_blank\">https://theuntamedtruth.com/news/former-wisconsin-judge-hannah-dugan-avoids-prison-after-ice-confrontation</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 55, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2121636163970548161", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiHTD5X", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 117, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8940243, "raw_content": "", "author": "Belleoffreedom", "created": 1794695296961, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "billybaldwin2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/ScottMechkowski/status/2121636163970548161", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\n\nScott Mechkowski\n@ScottMechkowski\n\u00b7\nThe \"disappeared\" narrative is still making the rounds, so let me say it again. ICE doesn't kidnap anyone.", "last_comment_created": 1794699309728, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 117, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 1290, "heightRatio": 62, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW7Q2Y9WwAE9wsf.jpg", "height": 805}, {"width": 1176, "heightRatio": 86, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW7Q2ZAW4AApKP4.jpg", "height": 1020}, {"width": 1343, "heightRatio": 66, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW7Q2Y-XoAAnfQ9.jpg", "height": 896}, {"width": 1204, "heightRatio": 82, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW7Q2ZCWgAAsNVJ.jpg", "height": 996}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 0, "created": 1794515400000, "id": "2120977432778088624", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2099475340523626496/Pdt1aMU__normal.jpg", "displayName": "Scott Mechkowski", "username": "ScottMechkowski"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8 ICE DOESN'T KIDNAP AND IT DOESN'T \"DISAPPEAR\" ANYONE. THE NARRATIVE IS THE POINT.\n\nThe New York Times and the open-borders lawyers say ICE is \"disappearing\" people. That's a lie.\n\nNobody disappeared. ICE knows exactly where every detainee is, and every one of them can pick up", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 217}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": {"image": "https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2120428749518704640/a69h7_JI?format=jpg&name=800x419", "domain": "www.washingtonexaminer.com", "description": "Police records debunk the viral claim that ICE abducted Martin Soto on a diaper run, proving he was arrested for domestic assault.", "title": "They called ICE \u2018kidnappers.\u2019 The paper proves otherwise", "url": "https://t.co/ljAHRW5cZA"}, "replies": 4, "created": 1794672454000, "id": "2121636163970548161", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2099475340523626496/Pdt1aMU__normal.jpg", "displayName": "Scott Mechkowski", "username": "ScottMechkowski"}, "content": "The \"disappeared\" narrative is still making the rounds, so let me say it again. ICE doesn't kidnap anyone. Every arrest leaves a paper trail: a charging document, a booking record, and a detainee locator anyone can search. I laid out the paperwork in the Washington Examiner:", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 158}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiHTlBc", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 61, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8940444, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1794707944174, "profile_picture": "TEnkk5XkT6JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "armyofpedes4usa", "is_video": true, "video_link": "https://cdn.videy.co/ELIADRD51.mp4", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "videy.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://videy.co/v?id=ELIADRD51", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Seinfeld goes to the DSA convention", "last_comment_